  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A preparatory consultancy with two health experts with the aim of     preparing a new intervention under the new country cooperation        strategy for Palestine 2015-2019. The consultancy is divided in three stages: 1)mapping of relevant health actors, 2) an indepth analysis   of ongoing Swedish health related interventions, and 3) moderating a  workshop with potential partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

M&#xe5;let med konsultuppdraget &#xe4;r att i tre faser bidra med en djupanalys och  kartl&#xe4;ggning av akt&#xf6;rer i h&#xe4;lsosektorn i Palestina samt ge konkreta ing&#xe5;ngsm&#xf6;jligheter till en ny Sidafinansierad h&#xe4;lsoinsats under startegin 2015-2019.</narrative>
  </description>
